possible values of the type var, instead of replacing it like seems to happen now.\n\nSo in the above example, `repr` expects an `object`, so that would not restrict `AnyStr`. However, in this continuation of the example:\n\n``` python\ndef g(s: str): pass\n\ng(f(''))\n```\n\nThe context (`str`) would be used to restrict (and uniquely determine in this case) `AnyStr` to `str`.\n\nI'll try to implement this.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments/55489651/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"spkersten","id":4456832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTY4MzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4456832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spkersten","html_url":"https://github.com/spkersten","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spkersten/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spkersten/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spkersten/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spkersten/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spkersten/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spkersten/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spkersten/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spkersten/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spkersten/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"spkersten","id":4456832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTY4MzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4456832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spkersten","html_url":"https://github.com/spkersten","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spkersten/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.co